{
  "description": "Per-instruction-class emulator throughput (mips, higher is better) for native QEMU TCG and four browser engines, plus opencode --version wall time and the vCPU profile split. Each emubench test is a fixed inline-assembly shape so a ratio names a mechanism. See docs/engine-execution.md.",
